    "long_instructions": "##Define & Build\r\n\r\nUse the Sketch Lab canvas provided here to work through the process for launching your product.\r\n\r\n1. Complete the **_Define_** section of your canvas:\r\n    - Pick a _topic of interest_, identify _issues_, _brainstorm_ solutions, and select an _audience_ for the product.\r\n2. Complete the **_Build_** section of your canvas: \r\n    - Create a Product Spec Sheet to document details about your product\r\n    - Draft your System Prompt using Task, Context, Format, Retrieval, and Tone as building blocks\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
